                            <div class="small text-body">
                                <strong>DANGER:</strong> Restoring from a backup will wipe and overwrite the entire current database structure. All unsaved changes since the backup was made will be lost forever.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <form action="{{ url_for('settings.import_data') }}" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data">
